  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Melt butter with olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add Brussels sprouts, jerk seasoning, curry powder, brown sugar, and garlic powder; stir until evenly coated. Cook and stir until Brussels sprouts are tender and lightly caramelized, about 5 to 10 minutes.",
